  "prefLabel": "Ph 705.03 Destruction of Inventory Controlled Substances",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 705.03 Destruction of Inventory Controlled Substances. Any person legally possessing inventory controlled substances who wishes to dispose of such substances shall comply with applicable requirements of the DEA in 21 CFR Part 1317, including using DEA Form 41 and complying with any requirements of the regional DEA office relative to providing advance notice and an opportunity to observe.\n\nSource. #4600, eff 8-1-89; ss by #6094-B, INTERIM, eff 9-21-95, EXPIRED, 1-19-96\n\nNew. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04\n\nNew. #8316, eff 3-26-05; ss by #8572, eff 2-23-06, EXPIRED: 2-23-14\n\nNew. #10903, eff 8-5-15; ss by #13398, eff 6-22-22 (formerly Ph 707.01); ss by #14648, eff 10-13-26, EXPIRES: 10-13-36 (formerly Ph 705.01)",
